WEBVTT

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.930
<i>Long, long ago...</i>

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:07.140
<i>Even before gods descended to this world...</i>

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:10.610
<i>The ultimate evil fought against humanity.</i>

00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:11.990
<i>Monsters.</i>

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:15.110
There! Over there!

00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:18.580
Don't let it get away!

00:00:36.230 --> 00:00:38.490
<i>Humans cannot forgive them.</i>

00:00:38.490 --> 00:00:42.340
<i>Even gods cannot save them.</i>

00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:55.950
A vouivre?

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:01.710
<i>Humans and monsters will
never live in harmony.</i>

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:04.960
<b>Is It Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon? III</b>

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:08.670
Wiene
Dragon's Daughter

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:18.250
<i>A monster... crying?</i>

00:01:37.150 --> 00:01:39.790
Where'd it go? That vouivre!

00:01:40.310 --> 00:01:42.520
It can't be far! Find it!

00:01:44.730 --> 00:01:48.150
Hey, you. Have you seen
a vouivre around here?

00:01:48.150 --> 00:01:51.160
M-More urgently, do you have a potion?

00:01:51.530 --> 00:01:53.380
I've got someone who's been badly burned—

00:01:56.630 --> 00:01:57.870
How's that my problem?

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:32.410
Bell-dono!

00:02:34.700 --> 00:02:35.760
Everyone...

00:02:36.320 --> 00:02:38.160
We've been looking for you.

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:40.980
When we got separated, we worried 
about what might happen, but...

00:02:40.980 --> 00:02:42.090
I'm glad you're all right.

00:02:42.090 --> 00:02:45.910
Acting solo here on the 
Nineteenth Floor is dangerous.

00:02:45.910 --> 00:02:47.910
Um... Bell-sama...

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:49.760
Who is that person?

00:02:50.210 --> 00:02:53.150
For now... let's go back 
to the Eighteenth Floor.

00:02:56.770 --> 00:02:58.290
And now, Bell-sama...

00:02:58.290 --> 00:03:00.940
Who is this person, and where is she from?

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:06.360
Did you go and bring in trouble 
again by saving some unknown woman?

00:03:15.890 --> 00:03:17.670
Explain this, Bell!

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:19.680
Wait, everyone! She's—

00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:23.250
Please, step aside, Bell-sama! 
What on earth are you thinking?

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:26.540
Did you bring her along because 
she's got a pretty face?

00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:30.460
That would just make you 
some kind of monster fetishist!

00:03:30.460 --> 00:03:31.440
I-It's not like—

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:33.450
Bell-sama, monsters are monsters!

00:03:33.450 --> 00:03:35.030
They are the enemies of humanity!

00:03:35.890 --> 00:03:37.490
Bell! Get away from there!

00:03:37.490 --> 00:03:38.400
Bell-dono!

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:39.850
Bell-sama!

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:45.280
Be...ll...

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:48.000
Bell...

00:03:48.820 --> 00:03:52.590
Y-Yes. That's my name.

00:03:52.590 --> 00:03:53.700
Bell...

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:56.960
You... Your name is Bell.

00:03:57.210 --> 00:03:59.910
That monster... spoke.

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:01.640
You've gotta be kidding me.

00:04:03.280 --> 00:04:06.750
Bell-sama, what happened
 between you and her?

00:04:07.460 --> 00:04:09.440
I found her on the Nineteenth Floor.

00:04:10.150 --> 00:04:13.510
She was being hunted by adventurers 
and attacked by monsters.

00:04:13.510 --> 00:04:15.590
She was trembling and crying!

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:19.050
I want to help her.

00:04:19.450 --> 00:04:21.280
We cannot do that, Bell-sama!

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:24.950
If people find out we're sheltering 
a monster, the Hestia Familia is done for!

00:04:24.950 --> 00:04:26.120
Even so...

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:27.160
I don't want to abandon her!

00:04:34.380 --> 00:04:36.250
Oh, just do whatever you want.

00:04:39.820 --> 00:04:41.450
I'm sorry, everyone.

00:04:41.450 --> 00:04:42.770
Thank you.

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:44.820
What do we do next?

00:04:44.820 --> 00:04:47.020
Are we going to take
her with us to the surface?

00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:48.110
Yes.

00:04:48.110 --> 00:04:51.150
In the Dungeon, she'd only be attacked again.

00:04:51.150 --> 00:04:54.280
Once we get back home, I want to 
ask the Goddess's opinion, too.

00:04:54.280 --> 00:04:55.390
Home?

00:04:55.910 --> 00:04:57.140
Yes.

00:04:57.140 --> 00:04:58.880
Come to our house with us.

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:03.780
This isn't good, Ouranos.

00:05:04.140 --> 00:05:07.730
A monster endowed with intelligence 
has made contact with an adventurer,

00:05:08.250 --> 00:05:10.260
and will soon leave Babel.

00:05:10.260 --> 00:05:13.500
And who is this adventurer, Fels?

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:14.910
Bell Cranel.

00:05:15.190 --> 00:05:19.410
The Little Rookie. Hermes' favorite, is it?

00:05:19.410 --> 00:05:20.600
What will you do?

00:05:20.600 --> 00:05:25.600
For better or worse, the Hestia Familia 
has gained too much attention in town.

00:05:26.070 --> 00:05:27.810
I would like to determine

00:05:27.810 --> 00:05:33.340
whether Hestia's family can 
become their hope, or not.

00:05:35.110 --> 00:05:37.060
What did you say?

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:40.780
I-I've never heard of a talking monster!

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:44.190
I-I thought that might be the case.

00:05:44.670 --> 00:05:48.290
To be honest, I don't know 
how I should take this.

00:05:48.290 --> 00:05:51.080
But when she's this scared, well...

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:52.560
Then you mean...

00:05:52.560 --> 00:05:53.560
Yes.

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:55.580
We'll look after her here for a while.

00:05:57.680 --> 00:05:59.020
Say, you there.

00:05:59.020 --> 00:06:00.430
Do you have a name?

00:06:00.430 --> 00:06:01.490
Name?

00:06:01.940 --> 00:06:02.700
Bell.

00:06:02.700 --> 00:06:05.100
Oh, no. That's my name.

00:06:05.100 --> 00:06:05.670
What's yours?

00:06:06.900 --> 00:06:09.620
My own... name?

00:06:09.620 --> 00:06:11.480
I thought she might not have one.

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:14.240
The name of her species is "vouivre," but...

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:16.260
That isn't her individual name.

00:06:16.580 --> 00:06:18.720
Bell, you decide.

00:06:18.720 --> 00:06:19.430
What?

00:06:19.430 --> 00:06:22.470
That's right, Bell-kun. You're the
 one who brought her here.

00:06:22.470 --> 00:06:25.510
You must take responsibility 
and be the one who names her!

00:06:29.290 --> 00:06:31.020
I-In that case...

00:06:31.020 --> 00:06:31.930
Um...

00:06:32.400 --> 00:06:34.610
Maybe... V-Vergine?

00:06:35.070 --> 00:06:38.490
Bell-sama, that's the name of a divine 
spirit in those heroic tales.

00:06:39.340 --> 00:06:41.460
Yes! Do you think it's no good?

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:45.340
Well, for Bell-sama, it's pretty good...

00:06:46.020 --> 00:06:49.260
But it's kinda long. And too fancy.

00:06:49.830 --> 00:06:51.330
It is pretentious.

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:53.500
In that case!

00:06:54.160 --> 00:06:56.650
How about we shorten it to Wiene-kun?

00:06:56.650 --> 00:06:58.390
To... Wiene?

00:07:01.350 --> 00:07:03.900
Wie...ne?

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:06.240
My... name?

00:07:06.980 --> 00:07:07.860
Wiene!

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:09.570
I'm Wiene!

00:07:10.600 --> 00:07:14.220
But there's no mistaking that she is a monster.

00:07:14.220 --> 00:07:16.050
We need to gather information.

00:07:16.440 --> 00:07:18.490
Let's split up and ask around.

00:07:18.490 --> 00:07:20.780
Are there other individuals like her?

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:24.410
What is happening in the Dungeon right now?

00:07:24.410 --> 00:07:25.900
That's what we want to know.

00:07:25.900 --> 00:07:29.410
Outside of the deities Hephaistios, 
Miach, and Take and their familias,

00:07:29.410 --> 00:07:32.390
be careful not to appear 
to be digging too deeply.

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:34.200
It doesn't matter what it is,

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:36.050
find some kind of lead.

00:07:37.150 --> 00:07:38.870
That's what happened.

00:07:38.870 --> 00:07:41.210
Can you think of anything?

00:07:42.040 --> 00:07:44.330
It is difficult to believe,

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:45.930
but the possibilities in the Lower World...

00:07:45.930 --> 00:07:49.370
Sometimes they go beyond what even 
gods can predict, into the unknown.

00:07:51.850 --> 00:07:52.900
Mikoto...

00:07:52.900 --> 00:07:56.190
How do you feel about this? 
About this monster?

00:07:56.600 --> 00:07:57.520
I don't know.

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:00.540
I don't sense any hostility.

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:02.990
She truly seems just like 
any ordinary girl, but...

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:05.700
I can't stop feeling anxious.

00:08:06.240 --> 00:08:08.340
She is a monster...

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:09.840
I fear her.

00:08:11.680 --> 00:08:16.130
Hey, did you hear? The story about 
a monster who stole some armor.

00:08:16.130 --> 00:08:18.150
The armed monster, right?

00:08:18.150 --> 00:08:21.020
I heard it's starting to appear 
in the Middle Floors now, too.

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:21.990
Yeah.

00:08:21.990 --> 00:08:25.060
They say those guys from Livira 
had a rough time with it.

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:26.220
Oh. Is that it?

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:33.930
It can't be... Right?

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:41.410
What is that?

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:44.910
That's the sun.

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:47.080
It is called "the sun."

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:49.640
The sun... It's warm!

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:53.730
Above ground is pretty, isn't it?

00:08:54.570 --> 00:08:56.920
This is too warm and cozy!

00:08:57.800 --> 00:08:59.010
I want to take it off!

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:01.270
You can't do that, Wiene-sama!

00:09:03.470 --> 00:09:06.290
J-Just bear with it, Wiene! All right?

00:09:26.690 --> 00:09:28.120
Alb Spring Water.

00:09:33.030 --> 00:09:36.780
Do you have any information 
on monsters that speak?

00:09:38.270 --> 00:09:40.050
Don't know a thing.

00:09:40.050 --> 00:09:42.880
Then is there someone who might know?

00:09:42.880 --> 00:09:44.220
I know something.

00:09:44.220 --> 00:09:46.150
Info on monsters that talk.

00:09:46.800 --> 00:09:48.870
It's just a scrap though.

00:09:50.100 --> 00:09:50.940
Madl?

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:52.010
Huh?

00:09:52.010 --> 00:09:54.380
You know my alias?

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:56.530
Master, honey beer!

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:58.010
So?

00:09:58.010 --> 00:09:59.480
What information do you have?

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:03.250
I got cleaned out gambling recently, so...

00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:05.760
I'm not even sure I'll be able 
to pay for this, you know?

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:15.960
In the Dungeon, sometimes, even when 
there aren't other adventurers around,

00:10:15.960 --> 00:10:19.880
people hear voices talking. The story's 
been making the rounds for a while.

00:10:20.150 --> 00:10:22.650
Sometimes they hear multiple 
voices talking...

00:10:22.650 --> 00:10:26.080
Some think they hear singing. 
There's been rumors of that, too.

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:27.600
What else...

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:32.730
There's someone who wants information 
on talking monsters, like you do.

00:10:33.100 --> 00:10:35.500
While no one else is taking 
the rumors seriously,

00:10:35.500 --> 00:10:38.670
it seems these people just won't let it go.

00:10:39.270 --> 00:10:40.960
And that group's identity?

00:10:41.930 --> 00:10:44.420
I'd love to know that, too.

00:10:44.420 --> 00:10:46.450
I've been tasked with that, you see.

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:50.550
I haven't seen you before, have I?
 Who are you affiliated with?

00:10:51.340 --> 00:10:54.160
You're pretty desperate for an elf.

00:10:56.730 --> 00:10:58.720
Huh? You're leaving already?

00:10:59.150 --> 00:11:02.420
I wanted to talk a little more!

00:11:06.960 --> 00:11:08.400
<i>I'm being followed.</i>

00:11:08.970 --> 00:11:11.290
<i>My opponent is a high-level adventurer.</i>

00:11:11.290 --> 00:11:12.880
<i>I can't afford to be choosy about my methods.</i>

00:11:13.730 --> 00:11:15.200
Wiene-sama?

00:11:15.200 --> 00:11:17.470
Would you like to have your meal now?

00:11:17.470 --> 00:11:20.340
You haven't eaten anything 
since yesterday, have you?

00:11:20.340 --> 00:11:21.660
Meal?

00:11:21.960 --> 00:11:23.110
Um...

00:11:23.110 --> 00:11:25.450
She's talking about food.

00:11:25.450 --> 00:11:27.920
I'll eat with you, so... Let's eat.

00:11:28.800 --> 00:11:29.630
Okay!

00:11:32.560 --> 00:11:33.770
Try some.

00:11:43.210 --> 00:11:44.220
Is it good?

00:11:44.480 --> 00:11:47.320
It's... good?

00:11:47.320 --> 00:11:49.250
Truly?

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:52.800
That is an "onigiri," 
which Mikoto-sama made for you.

00:11:52.800 --> 00:11:54.630
Please, have some of these fruits, as well!

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:24.310
Hey, Bell?

00:12:24.310 --> 00:12:24.790
Hm?

00:12:25.260 --> 00:12:28.290
The fruit had a really good smell!

00:12:28.290 --> 00:12:29.900
Yes, it did.

00:12:29.900 --> 00:12:31.920
They were juicy and sweet.

00:12:31.920 --> 00:12:34.050
The onigiri was good, too.

00:12:34.740 --> 00:12:36.500
Bell, was it good to you, too?

00:12:36.500 --> 00:12:38.670
Yes. It was very good.

00:12:43.590 --> 00:12:45.460
Bell. Bell!

00:12:52.710 --> 00:12:53.920
Bell-sama!

00:12:54.450 --> 00:12:55.910
I'll get the medicine kit!

00:12:58.160 --> 00:13:00.060
No... Bell...

00:13:00.740 --> 00:13:01.880
Does it hurt?

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:07.040
I... No!

00:13:07.620 --> 00:13:10.600
I'm sorry... I'm sorry, Bell!

00:13:23.330 --> 00:13:24.110
It's all right.

00:13:26.050 --> 00:13:27.320
Everything is all right.

00:13:35.140 --> 00:13:35.970
Good.

00:13:36.990 --> 00:13:38.090
Bell!

00:13:40.940 --> 00:13:42.070
Bell...

00:13:42.560 --> 00:13:43.620
Bell!

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:44.720
Stop that.

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:47.710
Bell...

00:13:58.460 --> 00:14:00.700
I'm home...

00:14:02.420 --> 00:14:04.490
How did it go for all of you?

00:14:04.490 --> 00:14:07.020
No good. There weren't any decent leads.

00:14:07.020 --> 00:14:10.910
Takemikazuchi-sama said he couldn't 
think of anything, either.

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:13.560
Lili went through quite a bit, too...

00:14:16.570 --> 00:14:17.820
Bell-kun?

00:14:19.440 --> 00:14:21.440
Go ahead, Wiene-sama.

00:14:23.980 --> 00:14:27.190
W-Welcome home.

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:30.560
She seems to have taken quite a liking to you.

00:14:30.560 --> 00:14:34.050
Haruhime-kun! 
You have the makings of a mother!

00:14:39.210 --> 00:14:40.770
It's good!

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:42.600
Mikoto, you're amazing!

00:14:42.600 --> 00:14:44.890
Th-Thank you very much.

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:50.130
Haruhime told me. She said 
Mikoto's food is really good!

00:14:50.130 --> 00:14:53.610
Not at all! I still lack in discipline.

00:14:55.430 --> 00:14:57.960
To think I'd be complimented in 
such a straightforward manner...

00:14:57.960 --> 00:14:59.070
Mikoto-sama!

00:14:59.070 --> 00:15:00.920
It's a monster that's complimenting you.

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:02.460
Don't lower your guard over something like this!

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:05.070
You're much too rigid, Miss Supporter.

00:15:05.070 --> 00:15:08.190
At times like these, it's how you 
respond to it that's important.

00:15:08.190 --> 00:15:10.500
It's more that you're much 
too relaxed, Goddess.

00:15:10.500 --> 00:15:12.320
Now, let's not worry about it!

00:15:12.320 --> 00:15:15.050
Here, Wiene-kun! Eat mine, too!

00:15:17.750 --> 00:15:19.220
It's good!

00:15:19.220 --> 00:15:21.510
It is, isn't it?

00:15:23.030 --> 00:15:23.470
Here you are.

00:15:26.160 --> 00:15:28.650
Still, she sure has started talking a lot.

00:15:28.650 --> 00:15:29.500
Yeah.

00:15:29.500 --> 00:15:31.680
As we were playing this afternoon, 
she started talking more and more.

00:15:31.680 --> 00:15:33.980
It's just... I'm not Li'l Lili, but...

00:15:34.480 --> 00:15:36.420
Are you sure you're all right 
with things like this?

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:40.660
Welf, are you wary of her, too?

00:15:41.470 --> 00:15:44.170
The truth is, I feel like everything 
I thought has been undermined.

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:46.430
Come on, Miss Supporter! You, too!

00:15:46.430 --> 00:15:48.320
Lili is fine as she is, thank you.

00:15:48.320 --> 00:15:49.630
Don't say that.

00:15:49.630 --> 00:15:51.280
I'm fine, thank you.

00:15:51.280 --> 00:15:54.370
I guess for you, it's more 
of a weight off your mind.

00:15:54.890 --> 00:15:57.790
Or are you feeling lonely 
now that they've taken her?

00:15:57.790 --> 00:15:59.550
Nothing like that.

00:16:16.050 --> 00:16:18.040
Why isn't Bell with us?

00:16:19.130 --> 00:16:20.710
That's because...

00:16:20.710 --> 00:16:23.170
Bell-sama is male. Of course he's not here.

00:16:23.480 --> 00:16:27.040
There's a lot that goes on between 
males and females, Wiene-kun.

00:16:37.340 --> 00:16:38.810
This is paradise.

00:16:39.120 --> 00:16:41.520
How do you like the bath, Wiene-kun?

00:16:41.860 --> 00:16:43.090
It feels good!

00:16:44.370 --> 00:16:47.110
Is something wrong, Lili-sama?

00:16:47.950 --> 00:16:51.970
There are too many people with
 well-built bodies in this familia.

00:16:57.910 --> 00:16:59.740
Honestly...

00:17:00.240 --> 00:17:02.040
I'd rather be with Bell after all!

00:17:03.610 --> 00:17:05.880
W-Wait! Wiene-kun!

00:17:05.880 --> 00:17:07.540
No! You mustn't!

00:17:08.620 --> 00:17:09.500
Huh?

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:10.440
Wiene?

00:17:10.440 --> 00:17:12.010
Wait! Huh?

00:17:21.020 --> 00:17:22.570
All right. Done.

00:17:26.180 --> 00:17:27.760
Thank you, Welf!

00:17:27.930 --> 00:17:28.870
No problem.

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:37.440
Bell... It doesn't hurt?

00:17:37.440 --> 00:17:39.510
No. It doesn't hurt.

00:17:42.720 --> 00:17:44.510
Bell! Bell!

00:17:44.860 --> 00:17:47.110
Why are you so happy, Bell-sama?

00:17:47.110 --> 00:17:48.600
Her nails will eventually grow back.

00:17:48.600 --> 00:17:51.370
If they aren't filed down, they may
 cause even greater injury.

00:17:51.370 --> 00:17:52.810
Th-That's true, but...

00:17:54.490 --> 00:17:56.710
Lili, do you hate Bell?

00:17:56.710 --> 00:17:58.420
What's this all of a sudden?

00:17:58.420 --> 00:17:59.440
You hate him?

00:17:59.930 --> 00:18:01.330
Well, that's...

00:18:01.330 --> 00:18:02.770
That's not...

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:06.680
I...

00:18:06.680 --> 00:18:08.980
I love Bell-sama!

00:18:09.930 --> 00:18:10.990
Yeah.

00:18:10.990 --> 00:18:12.350
I love him, too.

00:18:12.600 --> 00:18:14.200
And, of course, I do, too!

00:18:14.750 --> 00:18:15.910
As do I!

00:18:20.640 --> 00:18:23.360
Oh, honestly! So does Lili!

00:18:23.360 --> 00:18:25.670
I love Bell-sama!

00:18:25.670 --> 00:18:26.580
Me, too.

00:18:27.610 --> 00:18:30.670
I love everyone, too.

00:18:31.780 --> 00:18:32.830
Everyone...

00:18:32.830 --> 00:18:36.920
Bell... and everyone... 
love each other, right?

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:41.910
It's so warm!

00:18:47.590 --> 00:18:49.730
It may simply be pity,

00:18:50.490 --> 00:18:52.960
but I feel the same way Bell-sama does.

00:18:52.960 --> 00:18:54.280
That girl...

00:18:54.280 --> 00:18:56.560
Wiene-sama... I don't want to abandon her.

00:18:56.560 --> 00:18:57.840
For me...

00:18:58.240 --> 00:19:00.390
I have no clear answer.

00:19:00.390 --> 00:19:03.170
However, Wiene-dono's smile...

00:19:03.170 --> 00:19:06.100
It does not look different 
to me than any of ours.

00:19:07.060 --> 00:19:08.250
If it is possible...

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:11.110
If we could continue to cultivate 
our bonds this way...

00:19:12.050 --> 00:19:13.610
The gods...

00:19:13.610 --> 00:19:16.810
I think they must know something 
about the Dungeon.

00:19:16.810 --> 00:19:20.530
They know and hide things from 
the people of this world.

00:19:20.530 --> 00:19:21.560
They probably do.

00:19:21.560 --> 00:19:24.700
And even for those gods, this is
 an unforeseen situation.

00:19:25.070 --> 00:19:29.780
There is no doubt that we are caught up 
in an incredibly troublesome problem.

00:19:29.780 --> 00:19:32.250
You helped bring her here, too, didn't you?

00:19:32.250 --> 00:19:33.970
You want to rehash all of it again now?

00:19:34.270 --> 00:19:36.130
I never agreed with it.

00:19:36.130 --> 00:19:37.640
I just gave up fighting it.

00:19:38.100 --> 00:19:40.440
Because Bell-sama is the most 
softhearted person ever.

00:19:41.000 --> 00:19:43.160
We can't let ourselves be swayed by emotion.

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:45.650
If anyone allows themselves 
to trust that girl...

00:19:46.050 --> 00:19:47.870
I know it will mean trouble for someone.

00:19:48.350 --> 00:19:51.050
It isn't possible for things to stay this way.

00:19:51.050 --> 00:19:54.010
Because that girl is a monster.

00:19:55.560 --> 00:19:59.470
Goddess, wouldn't it be better
for you to sleep in your own room?

00:19:59.470 --> 00:20:01.140
Isn't it cramped here?

00:20:01.140 --> 00:20:02.570
It's great, isn't it?

00:20:02.570 --> 00:20:05.050
There are no boundaries between family, right?

00:20:05.050 --> 00:20:07.520
It's nice and warm!

00:20:11.430 --> 00:20:15.470
Wiene, where did you come from? 
Didn't anyone come with you?

00:20:16.250 --> 00:20:17.500
I don't know.

00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:21.550
Before I knew it, I was in 
a dark place, all alone.

00:20:22.300 --> 00:20:24.920
I have a dream, about Bell and everyone.

00:20:25.210 --> 00:20:28.120
A dream about... attacking people.

00:20:29.560 --> 00:20:33.940
I claw at people I don't know... Bite them...

00:20:33.940 --> 00:20:35.500
Tear them to pieces...

00:20:36.150 --> 00:20:38.670
Lots and lots of things turn red.

00:20:39.020 --> 00:20:40.310
It's a scary dream.

00:20:41.570 --> 00:20:45.670
The me in the dream is really angry,

00:20:46.270 --> 00:20:47.880
but little by little, it gets cold.

00:20:49.050 --> 00:20:52.150
Lots of people, just like you, Bell,

00:20:52.610 --> 00:20:55.550
protect people... from me.

00:20:56.470 --> 00:20:58.830
My body grows cold.

00:20:59.580 --> 00:21:03.110
My chest is empty, as though 
there was a hole in it.

00:21:03.110 --> 00:21:06.190
I see those people so clearly...

00:21:07.300 --> 00:21:09.600
After that, it's always the same.

00:21:09.600 --> 00:21:12.740
I turn red, then dark.

00:21:13.490 --> 00:21:17.210
Even if I cry and ask for someone 
to save me, no one does.

00:21:17.830 --> 00:21:21.150
It's a really scary, lonely dream.

00:21:23.130 --> 00:21:27.500
So, you've all figured out the destination 
of the smuggled monsters, I take it?

00:21:27.820 --> 00:21:28.700
Yes.

00:21:28.700 --> 00:21:31.130
In the basement of a mansion belonging 
to a noble Elurian family,

00:21:31.130 --> 00:21:32.830
we found them chained up.

00:21:32.830 --> 00:21:33.850
Lulune...

00:21:33.850 --> 00:21:37.640
About the talking monsters. You said there's 
a child sniffing around, didn't you?

00:21:37.970 --> 00:21:38.760
Yeah.

00:21:38.760 --> 00:21:40.880
An elven kid I've never seen before.

00:21:40.880 --> 00:21:44.850
I tried to follow, but a scent-bag
 took out my nose.

00:21:46.110 --> 00:21:46.780
I'm sorry.

00:21:47.100 --> 00:21:49.770
The word of the client is absolute.

00:21:49.770 --> 00:21:52.360
All we can do is collect information.

00:21:53.060 --> 00:21:54.640
Honestly...

00:21:54.640 --> 00:21:58.300
You've really shoved a heap 
of trouble onto us, Ouranos.

00:21:59.970 --> 00:22:01.920
The Ikelos Familia, is it?

00:23:35.890 --> 00:23:40.890
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:35.890 --> 00:23:40.890
<b>Monster
One Wing</b>

00:23:37.500 --> 00:23:38.490
Next time,

00:23:38.490 --> 00:23:39.670
"Monster."
